EN: Current submission:1.3.3.4 SubmissionDocs. Runtime remains1.3.3.4/CloudAttachments. All Junior/Junior+ and selected Middle features are implemented; final acceptance corrects documentation and verifies published-source installation and owner-only Cloud demonstration. GraphQL root-page reads; RabbitMQ change signals with local fallback; Elasticsearch root/reply search with SQL reconciliation; Supabase private optional attachment copies with SQL originals. Cloud consent/replay lists are empty by default. No schema migration, provider/package/runtime change, new production service or volume. Preserve existing environment and all deployment overrides. Middle+ load tests, outbox, durable delivery and replicas need a separate scope.

